>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYELIG.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 PAYER-STATUS PIC X(16).
01 BENEFICIARY-STATUS PIC X(16).
01 ROUTE-TYPE PIC X(16).
01 OUTPUT-CODE PIC X(32).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO PAYER-STATUS BENEFICIARY-STATUS ROUTE-TYPE
    END-UNSTRING
    MOVE "ELIGIBLE" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    IF PAYER-STATUS NOT = "ACTIVE"
        MOVE "REJECT_PAYER" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
    STOP RUN.
